        "html": "<div class=\"roll-table\" id=\"minor-arcanum\"><div class=\"roll-table-head\"><button type=\"button\" class=\"dice-roll\" data-dice=\"1d6\" title=\"Clicca per tirare 1d6 — Maiusc: vantaggio · Ctrl: svantaggio\">1d6</button> <span class=\"roll-label\">arcano minore</span></div><table><tbody><tr><th scope=\"row\">1-2</th><td><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"minor-nerth-serpents-vigor.html\" data-slug=\"minor-nerth-serpents-vigor\" >Un anello d&#x27;oro</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">3-4</th><td><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"minor-revealing-light.html\" data-slug=\"minor-revealing-light\" >Una lampada a burro d&#x27;oro</a></td></tr><tr><th scope=\"row\">5-6</th><td><a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"minor-searing-touch.html\" data-slug=\"minor-searing-touch\" >Una lama d&#x27;acciaio arrugginita</a></td></tr></tbody></table></div>",
