        "html": "<h3 id=\"monsters\">Mostri</h3>\n<ul class=\"bullets\"><li>Predatori: <strong>puma</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >Il Gran Bosco</a>, <strong>kleztigr</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-steplands.html\" data-slug=\"the-steplands\" data-ref=\"page\" >Le Terre a Gradoni</a>, <strong>draghi da branco</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-flats.html\" data-slug=\"the-flats\" data-ref=\"page\" >Le Piane</a> o <strong>lupi</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >Il Gran Bosco</a></li><li>Grosse bestie irascibili: <strong>uri</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-flats.html\" data-slug=\"the-flats\" data-ref=\"page\" >Le Piane</a>, <strong>cinghiali</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-great-wood.html\" data-slug=\"the-great-wood\" data-ref=\"page\" >Il Gran Bosco</a> o un <strong>drago del tuono</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"the-flats.html\" data-slug=\"the-flats\" data-ref=\"page\" >Le Piane</a></li><li><strong>Spiriti della natura selvaggia</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"spirits-of-the-wild.html\" data-slug=\"spirits-of-the-wild\" data-ref=\"page\" >Gli Spiriti della Natura Selvaggia</a></li><li><strong>Fantasmi</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" data-ref=\"page\" >La morte e i non-morenti</a> o <strong>redivivi</strong> <a class=\"wiki-link\" href=\"death-and-the-undying.html\" data-slug=\"death-and-the-undying\" data-ref=\"page\" >La morte e i non-morenti</a>, in agguato vicino ad antichi campi di battaglia o insediamenti in rovina</li></ul>\n<hr>",
